[
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_01_round_start_01",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "round_start",
    "scene_title": "首回合引导",
    "line_index": 1,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "公子，先别急着出手。且先细读朝局简报，它会告诉你这半载的天下大势，后续施计均需围绕天下局势展开",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/01_round_start_01.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_02_round_start_02",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "round_start",
    "scene_title": "首回合引导",
    "line_index": 2,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "后续也可重温案卷，唯有对局势洞若观火，方能将毒针扎入北周要害",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/02_round_start_02.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_03_court_observe_01",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "court_observe",
    "scene_title": "地方军头与朝堂势力",
    "line_index": 1,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "北周核心权势人物来自地方军头与朝堂势力。地方军头各怀鬼胎，朝堂内部党争不断。这正是我们火中取栗的机会",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/03_court_observe_01.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_04_court_observe_02",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "court_observe",
    "scene_title": "地方军头与朝堂势力",
    "line_index": 2,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "每卷你有三次施计的机会，需对三位不同角色出手。公子切记，落子无悔",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/04_court_observe_02.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_05_external_faction_01",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "external_faction",
    "scene_title": "地方军头",
    "line_index": 1,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "陇右勋贵是虎据西北的军事贵族，他们的家族把持地方军政数十载，控遏与西域的商贸往来，部下精锐私兵唯领袖马首是瞻",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/05_external_faction_01.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_06_external_faction_02",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "external_faction",
    "scene_title": "地方军头",
    "line_index": 2,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "内附草原势力是被高官厚禄引诱而归附北周的草原部落族长，然草原狼的野心岂是区区财帛、官位能满足的？",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/06_external_faction_02.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_07_external_faction_03",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "external_faction",
    "scene_title": "地方军头",
    "line_index": 3,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "公子，如果你能善用计谋动摇军头们的忠诚度，并提升他们对你的信任度，你就有机会煽动他们割据或叛乱，割据与叛乱会显著削弱北周国力",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/07_external_faction_03.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_08_external_faction_04",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "external_faction",
    "scene_title": "地方军头",
    "line_index": 4,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "军头们的军力越强，割据与叛乱对北周国力产生的影响越显著",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/08_external_faction_04.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_09_court_faction_01",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "court_faction",
    "scene_title": "朝堂势力",
    "line_index": 1,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "帝党立主南征，希望借助南征统一全国军事调度，重塑皇室威严。后党企图稳固太后摄政秩序、强化中枢调度与地方控制，反对轻率南征",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/09_court_faction_01.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_10_court_faction_02",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "court_faction",
    "scene_title": "朝堂势力",
    "line_index": 2,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "两党综合实力由军力、朝堂影响力、内部稳定度构成。公子，你对朝中人物的每一次施计都会牵动两党实力变化",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/10_court_faction_02.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_11_court_faction_03",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "court_faction",
    "scene_title": "朝堂势力",
    "line_index": 3,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "当前我大陈国力尚弱，若要确保北周不提前南征毁了陛下的布局，需维持帝党的综合实力始终弱于后党，切记切记",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/11_court_faction_03.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_12_court_faction_04",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "court_faction",
    "scene_title": "朝堂势力",
    "line_index": 4,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "除了两党党魁，朝中其他人物均可以被罢黜，乃至处决，罢黜、处决朝中关键人物会显著削弱北周国力",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/12_court_faction_04.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_13_court_faction_05",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "court_faction",
    "scene_title": "朝堂势力",
    "line_index": 5,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "罢黜、处决朝中其他人物有两条前置条件：一，该人物的太后眷顾、皇帝恩宠均低于一定阈值；二，你需借帝后两党魁首之手，利用借刀计谋，实现罢黜、处决。唯有两党党魁对你的信任度足够高，方能借刀杀人",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/13_court_faction_05.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_14_npc_detail_01",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "npc_detail",
    "scene_title": "人物详情",
    "line_index": 1,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "北周这些老狐狸，每位都有不愿明说的私心。有人怕丢兵权，有人恨同僚抢功，有人暗藏自立之心",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/14_npc_detail_01.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_15_npc_detail_02",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "npc_detail",
    "scene_title": "人物详情",
    "line_index": 2,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "公子可用试探计谋，通过套话获取北周权势人物的情报，后续对该人物的施计应结合朝局、老臣的人物旁批、已知情报展开，方能有的放矢",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/15_npc_detail_02.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_16_scheme_phase_01",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "scheme_phase",
    "scene_title": "首次进入施计界面",
    "line_index": 1,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "公子如要对当前所选人物施计，选择相应计谋牌并补充说辞即可。老臣亦乐意帮公子拟写草稿",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/16_scheme_phase_01.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_17_scheme_phase_02",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "scheme_phase",
    "scene_title": "首次进入施计界面",
    "line_index": 2,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "说辞是否贴合时局和所选人物的立场，将决定计谋成败，以及计谋对帝后两党力量平衡、地方军头军力与忠诚度、北周国力的影响",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/17_scheme_phase_02.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_18_scheme_phase_03",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "scheme_phase",
    "scene_title": "首次进入施计界面",
    "line_index": 3,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "成功的施计将会提升该人物对你的信任度，信任度越高，能施展的计谋类型就越多",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/18_scheme_phase_03.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_19_scheme_card_advise_01",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "scheme_card_advise",
    "scene_title": "献策",
    "line_index": 1,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "对其晓以利害，顺其所欲献上利他而暗损北周国本之“良策”。对地方军头，可加深他对朝廷的不满、或助力壮大他的兵势",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/19_scheme_card_advise_01.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_20_scheme_card_advise_02",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "scheme_card_advise",
    "scene_title": "献策",
    "line_index": 2,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "公子切记，若你出的主意如果对北周整体也有好处，那你就是在资敌。好的献策应在迎合施计对象的个人利益同时暗中掏空北周",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/20_scheme_card_advise_02.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_21_scheme_card_slander_01",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "scheme_card_slander",
    "scene_title": "谗言",
    "line_index": 1,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "在施计对象甲心中种下对关联人物乙的疑心。若被攻击者是朝中人物，成功的谗言可能伤到他的皇帝恩宠、太后眷顾",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/21_scheme_card_slander_01.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_22_scheme_card_slander_02",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "scheme_card_slander",
    "scene_title": "谗言",
    "line_index": 2,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "对地方军头献谗言，或被攻击者是地方军头，均可能会动摇其对朝廷的忠诚度",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/22_scheme_card_slander_02.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_23_scheme_card_alienate_01",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "scheme_card_alienate",
    "scene_title": "离间",
    "line_index": 1,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "离间比谗言更进一步：将施计对象甲对关联人物乙的疑心扩大为实质性裂痕",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/23_scheme_card_alienate_01.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_24_scheme_card_alienate_02",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "scheme_card_alienate",
    "scene_title": "离间",
    "line_index": 2,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "因此，离间计谋对朝中人物皇帝恩宠、太后眷顾，地方军头忠诚度的影响要高于谗言",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/24_scheme_card_alienate_02.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_25_scheme_card_frame_01",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "scheme_card_frame",
    "scene_title": "嫁祸",
    "line_index": 1,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "布一个让目标自己踩进去的陷阱，诱其失言、犯错，引来朝中其他人的攻讦",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/25_scheme_card_frame_01.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_26_scheme_card_frame_02",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "scheme_card_frame",
    "scene_title": "嫁祸",
    "line_index": 2,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "公子需注意，如果施计对象是地方军头，虽能显著动摇其对朝廷的忠心，亦会增加朝廷对他的猜忌，收紧对他的粮饷、兵甲补给，导致他的军力有所削弱",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/26_scheme_card_frame_02.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_27_scheme_card_proxy_01",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "scheme_card_proxy",
    "scene_title": "借刀",
    "line_index": 1,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "待关联人物的皇帝恩宠与太后眷顾低于阈值，便可以借政党领袖之手正式收网",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/27_scheme_card_proxy_01.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_28_scheme_card_proxy_02",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "scheme_card_proxy",
    "scene_title": "借刀",
    "line_index": 2,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "公子需注意，朝堂人物可被罢黜或处决，处决对北周国力的影响显著高于罢黜。该人物的皇帝恩宠、太后眷顾越低，越有可能被处决",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/28_scheme_card_proxy_02.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_29_scheme_card_secession_01",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "scheme_card_secession",
    "scene_title": "煽动割据",
    "line_index": 1,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "公子需注意，煽动造反对北周国力的影响显著高于割据。因此公子当下需权衡，是见好就收，立刻煽动该人物割据，还是以静制动，待未来掀起更大的风暴",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/29_scheme_card_secession_01.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_30_scheme_card_omen_01",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
    "scene_key": "scheme_card_omen",
    "scene_title": "谶纬",
    "line_index": 1,
    "voice_id": "Chinese_radient_storyteller_vv1",
    "tts_text": "当前北周朝局诡谲，亦有天灾异动，正是利用谶纬散步谣言，攻讦朝臣的大好时机",
    "target_path": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide/30_scheme_card_omen_01.mp3",
    "model": "speech-2.8-hd",
    "speed": 1.3
  },
  {
    "id": "feng_daozhi_first_round_guide_31_scheme_card_omen_02",
    "role_slug": "feng_daozhi",
    "npc": "冯道之",
